Just a quick remider that tomorrow (Tuesday 4/28) from 10:00-12:00 is the  #maptimeDavis and Davis R Users Group “R for Spatial” workshop! See below for set-up instructions and details.

FAQ: Will this workshop be recorded?  Yes.  Recordings will be posted on the DataLab (formerly DSI) YouTube channel but not for a few weeks.

Please send any questions to Michele Tobias – mmto...@ucdavis.edu

